flowchart TD
    A([Frontend sends game request]) --> B[Fastify validates request with JSON schema]
    B --> C[GET valid JWT from auth-api]
    C --> D{JWT valid?}
    D -- No --> E([Reject request])
    D -- Yes --> F[Create game session]
    F --> G[Open WebSocket to pong-api with JWT]
    G --> H[Register event handler]
    H --> I[[Throttled interval: check game state]]
    I --> J[Parse game state]
    J --> K[Calculate bot move]
    K --> L[Send move via WebSocket]
    L --> I
    G --> M{Game over / error / inactivity?}
    M -- Yes --> N[Close WebSocket]
    N --> O[Delete game object]

    %% Async multi-game handling
    P([Async request handler]) --> Q{{Spawn/track game task}}
    Q --> F
    P --> R([Handle other games simultaneously])